MONDO:0005146 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "post-traumatic stress disorder" ;
    IAO:0000115 "An anxiety disorder precipitated by an experience of intense fear or horror while exposed to a traumatic (especially life-threatening) event. The disorder is characterized by intrusive recurring thoughts or images of the traumatic event; avoidance of anything associated with the event; a state of hyperarousal and diminished emotional responsiveness. These symptoms are present for at least one month and the disorder is usually long-term." ;
    mondo:curated_content_resource "https://www.malacards.org/card/post_traumatic_stress_disorder"^^xsd:anyURI ;
