MONDO:0008364 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Raynaud disease" ;
    IAO:0000115 "An episodic vasoconstriction resulting in discoloration of the skin and pain in the affected areas, often involving fingers or toes. Classically associated with triphasic color changes (white, blue, red) but may be biphasic. Often occurs in response to cold temperatures or emotional stress. May be primary or secondary to an underlying autoimmune disease." ;
