HP:0100763 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Abnormality of the lymphatic system" ;
    IAO:0000115 "An anomaly of the lymphatic system, a network of lymphatic vessels that carry a clear fluid called lymph unidirectionally towards either the right lymphatic duct or the thoracic duct, which in turn drain into the right and left subclavian veins respectively." ;
