MONDO:0100546 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "hereditary neuromuscular disease" ;
    IAO:0000115 "A heterogeneous group of genetic conditions with Mendelian (autosomal dominant, recessive, or X-linked) or chromosomal etiology that is characterized by progressive muscle degeneration and weakness." ;
